Did you give the box with the bird to the robot?

Did you train the robot to give a copy of the 2 to the bird?

Did you train the robot to copy the 1 and drop it on the 2?

Did you give the box back to the robot and then vacuum up the 2 from
the box in his thought bubble?

And did you give the box back to the robot?

Did you pick up the box with the nest and numbers after
the bird has put at least 5 numbers on her nest?

Well, well.  If I could I would give the box with the 2, 1 and bird
in it to the robot.  I'd train the robot to copy the 2 and give the
copy to the bird.  Then I'd train the robot to copy the 1 and drop
it on the 2 next to it.  That should be four steps so the robot should
have stopped.  Then I'd give the box to the robot again.  When Dusty
appears I'd vacuum up the 2 in the robot's thought bubble.  I'd give the
box back to the robot and wait until the bird has put at least 5 numbers
on her nest.  Then I'd pick up the box with her nest in it.


